    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chromatic Odyssey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Real-Time Roguelike Strategy Game of Cosmic Conquest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Chromatic Odyssey</i>, you command a fleet across a vibrant, procedurally generated galaxy where every choice, upgrade, and encounter shapes your journey.  Dive into real-time strategy with roguelike depth, where each run offers new tech paths, color-based combat (includes colorblind mode), and galaxy-bending combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time, Risk-Inspired Combat</strong>: A fast-paced blend of strategy and control where timing and tactics rule the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Choose Your Color, Wield Its Power</strong>: Start each run by picking a color, each granting a unique, game-changing ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Tech Tree, Your Way:</strong>  Whether your playstyle is aggressive, control, or economy-focused, choose from over 30 Tech Upgrades , ranging from AI engines and economic boosts to combat protocols. Stack powerful combos and craft your strategy every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions with Cosmic Impact</strong>: Disrupt enemy strategies with rare one-time-use potions ,scramble screen colors, halt enemy growth, or unleash wild anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Galaxy Map</strong>: Explore a branching star map, no two odysseys are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong>: Die, learn, and return stronger. Unlock new upgrades and strategies as you master the chromatic battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Odyssey Begins Now</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a tactical mastermind, a reckless warlord, or a tech-driven space savant? Shape your legacy in a living galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chromatic Odyssey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Real-Time Roguelike Strategy Game of Cosmic Conquest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Chromatic Odyssey</i>, you command a fleet across a vibrant, procedurally generated galaxy where every choice, upgrade, and encounter shapes your journey.  Dive into real-time strategy with roguelike depth, where each run offers new tech paths, color-based combat (includes colorblind mode), and galaxy-bending combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/44b5e7266dd8f9e10cb7b9d9167498ad.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time, Risk-Inspired Combat</strong>: A fast-paced blend of strategy and control where timing and tactics rule the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Choose Your Color, Wield Its Power</strong>: Start each run by picking a color, each granting a unique, game-changing ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Tech Tree, Your Way:</strong>  Whether your playstyle is aggressive, control, or economy-focused, choose from over 30 Tech Upgrades , ranging from AI engines and economic boosts to combat protocols. Stack powerful combos and craft your strategy every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions with Cosmic Impact</strong>: Disrupt enemy strategies with rare one-time-use potions ,scramble screen colors, halt enemy growth, or unleash wild anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Galaxy Map</strong>: Explore a branching star map, no two odysseys are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong>: Die, learn, and return stronger. Unlock new upgrades and strategies as you master the chromatic battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/e009aeaca8a0461397c2eb951cb030e1.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Odyssey Begins Now</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a tactical mastermind, a reckless warlord, or a tech-driven space savant? Shape your legacy in a living galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.poster.avif?t=1748423229\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.webm?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585710/extras/94607a61a718c21aebac5fd8029d9b56.mp4?t=1748423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Chromatic Odyssey is a real-time strategy roguelike where you command a rising Type II civilization. Conquer territories, harness advanced technology, and adapt to procedurally generated challenges. Deploy powerful abilities and shape the fate of your empire in an ever changing galaxy.",
